      "widgets_values": [
        "<h1>Field Notes</h1>\n<p>A short document that carries one of <strong>everything</strong> the export formats\ncarry, so an export can be opened and checked against it.</p>\n<h2>A bulleted list</h2>\n<ul><li>Headings, from <code>h1</code> to <code>h6</code></li>\n<li>Bold, italic, <u>underline</u> and <s>strikethrough</s></li>\n<li>Colour: <span style=\"color:#b3541e\">a warm brown</span> and <mark>a highlight</mark></li></ul>\n<h2>A numbered list</h2>\n<ol><li>First</li><li>Second</li><li>Third</li></ol>\n<h2>A table with a merged cell</h2>\n<table><caption>Exposure per plate</caption>\n<tr><th>Plate</th><th>Seconds</th><th>Filter</th></tr>\n<tr><td>A</td><td>120</td><td rowspan=\"2\">Wratten 12</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B</td><td>240</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">C and D together</td><td>none</td></tr></table>\n<h2>A quotation and a rule</h2>\n<blockquote>The plate is the record; the notebook is the argument.</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<pre>  two  spaces kept\n  and a second line</pre>\n<p>A link to <a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\">the repository</a>.</p>",
        "html",
        "Field Notes",
        "One of everything the fidelity table names.",
        "A. Writer",
        "(c) 2026 A. Writer, CC BY 4.0",
        "en",
        "notes, plates, exposure"
      ]
    },
